                            <p class="card-subtitle">with J. Shin, D. Shin, & W. Oh</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-content">
                        <p>Investigating when restrictions on AI-generated content spark or stifle community dynamics.</p>
                        <div class="research-tags">
                            <span class="tag">AI Regulation</span>
                            <span class="tag">Community Dynamics</span>
                            <span class="tag">Content Moderation</span>
